  Signal Processing\, Machine Learning\, Deep Representation Learning\, Na
 tural Language Processing & LLMs\nSize: XL\nSubmission type: Paper-based 
 / interactive demonstration papers\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked d
 ate: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Organizer and ISCA confirm Sao Paulo\, Aug 29-Sep
  2. Regular paper\, update\, and camera-ready days are announced without 
